{
  "@id": "urn:ship:ontology",
  "@type": "Ontology",
  "_comment_agent": "担当ユーザを指す属性（agentProperty）。**宣言しないとエンジンは誰が担当かを知らない**——既定は bare な \"agent\" なので、OK押下の押し主が記録されず（追記248 の配下ロックが掛からない）、督促の宛先も決まらない。bindings ファイルにも書けるが、GUI は bindings を渡さないので、**オントロジー側が正典である**",
  "agentProperty": "urn:ship:agent",
  "_comment": "クラスid・属性idは URI 形式でなければならない（bare な名前は schemaObjectFromByteStream が拾わず、getCardinality が「未知のクラスid」で落ちる）。一方 range のデータ型名は接頭辞付き（xsd:...）では解決されないので、そのままの名前で書く。非負整数であることは ≧0 という不等式として組込述語の連立に入る",
  "defines": [
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:Template",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "wam:isComplete",
          "minCardinality": 0,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        }
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "テンプレート",
        "en": "Template"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:Goal",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Task"
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "ゴール",
        "en": "Goal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:Atom",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Template"
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "アトムノード",
        "en": "Atom"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:Task",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Atom"
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "タスクノード",
        "en": "Task"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:Constraint",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Atom"
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "制約ノード",
        "en": "Constraint"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:OtherAtom",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Atom"
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "その他のアトムノード",
        "en": "Other atom"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:Person",
      "@type": "Class",
      "label": {
        "ja": "人",
        "en": "Person"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:agent",
      "@type": "ObjectProperty",
      "range": "urn:ship:Person",
      "label": {
        "ja": "担当者",
        "en": "Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:出荷",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Task",
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "urn:ship:個数",
          "minCardinality": 1,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        },
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "urn:ship:agent",
          "minCardinality": 1,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        },
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "wam:completeByOkButton",
          "minCardinality": 0,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        }
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "出荷",
        "en": "Shipment"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:個数",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:出荷",
      "_comment": "0個の出荷は出荷ではないので positiveInteger である（同期の確認）",
      "range": "positiveInteger",
      "label": {
        "ja": "個数",
        "en": "Count"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:検収",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Task",
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "urn:ship:納入数",
          "minCardinality": 1,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        },
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "urn:ship:返品数",
          "minCardinality": 1,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        },
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "urn:ship:agent",
          "minCardinality": 1,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        },
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "wam:completeByOkButton",
          "minCardinality": 0,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        }
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "検収",
        "en": "Acceptance"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:納入数",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:検収",
      "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
      "label": {
        "ja": "納入数",
        "en": "Delivered count"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:返品数",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:検収",
      "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
      "label": {
        "ja": "返品数",
        "en": "Returned count"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:出荷+検収",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:OtherAtom",
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "urn:ship:出荷済数",
          "minCardinality": 1,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        },
        {
          "@type": "Restriction",
          "onProperty": "urn:ship:要出荷数",
          "minCardinality": 1,
          "maxCardinality": 1
        }
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "出荷＋検収",
        "en": "Ship and accept"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:出荷済数",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:出荷+検収",
      "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
      "label": {
        "ja": "出荷済数",
        "en": "Shipped count"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:要出荷数",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:出荷+検収",
      "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
      "label": {
        "ja": "要出荷数",
        "en": "Count to ship"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:＝",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Constraint"
      ],
      "builtInFunction": "=",
      "isConstraint": true,
      "label": {
        "ja": "＝",
        "en": "Equals"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:≧",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Constraint"
      ],
      "builtInFunction": "≧",
      "isConstraint": true,
      "label": {
        "ja": "≧",
        "en": "At least"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:ship:納品ゴール",
      "@type": "Class",
      "subClassOf": [
        "urn:ship:Goal"
      ],
      "label": {
        "ja": "納品ゴール",
        "en": "Delivery goal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:wamtest:Then",
      "@type": "Class",
      "linkKind": "then",
      "_comment": "リンクは属性ではなくクラスである。arg1 が始点、arg2 が終点。",
      "label": {
        "ja": "Then",
        "en": "Then"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "arg1",
      "@type": "ObjectProperty",
      "label": {
        "ja": "第1引数",
        "en": "Arg 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "arg2",
      "@type": "ObjectProperty",
      "label": {
        "ja": "第2引数",
        "en": "Arg 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "完成の属性の上位属性（追記249）。complete と completeByOkButton はどちらもこれの下位属性であり、cardinality を1以下にすることで「いずれか一方しか使えない」が表される。",
      "@id": "wam:isComplete",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:Template",
      "range": "string",
      "label": {
        "ja": "完成",
        "en": "Is complete"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "OKボタンを持たないノードの完成（2値）。",
      "@id": "wam:complete",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:Template",
      "range": "boolean",
      "subPropertyOf": "wam:isComplete",
      "label": {
        "ja": "完成",
        "en": "Complete"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "OKボタンによる完成（3値。偽＝未完成、真＝完成したが未押下、ユーザ＝その人が確認した）。**この属性を宣言することが「OKボタンを持つ」の宣言である**（追記249。completionMode は使わない）。",
      "@id": "wam:completeByOkButton",
      "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
      "domain": "urn:ship:Template",
      "range": "string",
      "subPropertyOf": "wam:isComplete",
      "label": {
        "ja": "完成（OKボタン）",
        "en": "Complete by OK button"
      }
    }
  ]
}
